# Row witnesses for outside-kernel fusion

The ten words are defined in `Max1Fusion.OutsideSetup`, using the literal ATLAS
J4G1-max1W1 generators documented in `Cardinality.Subgroup`. These additional
rows witness square-one relations and odd powers of products with conjugates
of a or (ababb)^5. The generator in `source/generate.py` is untrusted; the
product modules check every multiplication using Lean's kernel.
-/

